NiceMon V9.9
? lists the commands
> ?
r [ADDR]      run the program at ADDR, or at 00008000; r 0 restarts
l             load lines of ADDR WORD in hex, as a .bin file has them
x             run the demo of the ROM, which F12 leaves
d [ADDR] [N]  show N words from ADDR, in hex, or the next ones
u [ADDR] [N]  disassemble N instructions from ADDR, or the next ones
sd [SLOT] LBA show sector LBA of the SD card in SLOT, or in the last slot
i [A.B.C.D]   show the IP address, or set it, such as 192.168.1.65
i dhcp        get the IP address from a DHCP server
m [MAC]       show the MAC address, or set it, such as 02:4E:49:43:45:01
c             clear the screen
v             the version
h             halt the core
?             the commands
PgUp PgDn     scroll back, before a command; MEGA with CRSR up or down
